{{JPExclusive}}
'''Emilia & Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Emilia & Doge
|image = E 597.png
|appearance = [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has decent stats and an [[Omni Strike]] that allows it to reach up to 300 range. their [[Freeze|freeze]] ability isn't much of a threat as its uptime is terrible.

==Strategy==
Spam your standard meatshields and use attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], and anything else you think will help. they only really have their health going for them, so just wait them out and they will die. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can speed up the process, but he's far from needed.

